Zig
  https://ziglang.org
  Copyright (c) Zig contributors. The MIT License (Expat). Zig is developed by the Zig Software Foundation and the
  Zig contributors.
  The image build downloads Zig 0.17.0 (zig-aarch64-linux-0.17.0.tar.xz, checked against its sha256) to compile
  TensorFold's Zig engine; the compiler is used in the build stage only and is not part of the published image.

xgrammar and dlpack (inside libtfgrammar.so)
  https://github.com/mlc-ai/xgrammar (MLC-AI team), https://github.com/dmlc/dlpack (DLPack contributors). Apache License, Version 2.0.
  scripts/prepare.sh copies the prebuilt lib/libtfgrammar.so out of TensorFold's v1.3.3 release archive (aarch64, checked against its
  SHA-256 in scripts/config.sh) into /opt/tensorfold/native/lib, with the archive's xgrammar and dlpack license and notice files in
  /opt/tensorfold/share/doc/tensorfold/LICENSES-grammar. Nothing of it is modified or compiled here.

